OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of hospital's orthopaedic
OL,4,Apatients 'harmed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of orthopaedic patients -
OL,7,Fmostly children - suffered "harm" at an
OL,8,FNHS hospital which is currently
OL,9,Freviewing cases dealt with by a
OL,10,Fsuspended surgeon.
OL,12,FKuldeep Stohr was suspended by
OL,13,FAddenbrooke's Hospital in Cambridge
OL,14,Flast year, amid concerns about
OL,15,Fsurgeries that were "below the expected
OL,16,Fstandard".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
