OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of hospital's orthopaedic
OL,4,Apatients 'harmed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a now-removed report to the hospital
OL,7,Ftrust's board, it stated of the 924
OL,8,Fpatients reviewed so far, 209
OL,9,F"experienced harm", the majority of
OL,10,Fwhom were children when they had
OL,11,Felective surgery. Forty-seven were
OL,12,Fclassed as severe, with one being
OL,13,Ffatal.
OL,15,FNicola Ayton, chief executive at
OL,16,FCambridge University Hospitals (CUH),
OL,17,Fsaid she was "deeply sorry" to patients
OL,18,Fand families affected.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
